          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Isopure makes one of the leanest flavored protein powders you can buy. Zero Carb gives about 25 g of whey isolate protein for roughly 100 calories and no carbohydrate, Low Carb trades a few grams of carbohydrate for richer flavors, Unflavored strips out the sweetener and vitamins, and Clear turns isolate into a juice-style drink.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
